WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.833 --> 00:00:02.501
-Today the house voted

00:00:02.501 --> 00:00:05.604
to send articles of impeachment
against President Trump

00:00:05.604 --> 00:00:07.673
to the Senate
as damning new evidence emerges

00:00:07.673 --> 00:00:08.942
against Trump's henchmen.

00:00:08.942 --> 00:00:11.177
For more on this, it's time
for "A Closer Look."

00:00:11.177 --> 00:00:15.448 line:0%
[ Suspenseful theme plays ]
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:00:15.448 --> 00:00:17.683
It's official:
We will now have the third

00:00:17.683 --> 00:00:18.918
Senate impeachment trial

00:00:18.918 --> 00:00:20.519
of a president
in American history.

00:00:20.519 --> 00:00:23.223
And, knowing that this
historic moment was coming,

00:00:23.223 --> 00:00:25.658
Trump decided
to soothe his ego last night

00:00:25.658 --> 00:00:28.194
by holding another one
of his group therapy sessions

00:00:28.194 --> 00:00:29.295
in Wisconsin,
[ Laughter ]

00:00:29.295 --> 00:00:30.796
where he surrounded himself

00:00:30.796 --> 00:00:32.565
with his cult
of fawning admirers

00:00:32.565 --> 00:00:33.933
and tried to fill the stage

00:00:33.933 --> 00:00:36.636
with as many underwhelming
white guys as possible.

00:00:36.636 --> 00:00:37.837
[ Laughter ]

00:00:37.837 --> 00:00:39.538
I guess to make himself
look good by comparison?

00:00:39.538 --> 00:00:41.874
I mean, look at this. This looks
like the audition room

00:00:41.874 --> 00:00:43.076
for a Cialis commercial.

00:00:43.076 --> 00:00:45.411
[ Laughter ]
It's like the curtain call

00:00:45.411 --> 00:00:46.946
for a regional
theater production

00:00:46.946 --> 00:00:48.448
of "12 Angry White men."

00:00:48.448 --> 00:00:49.682
[ Laughter ]

00:00:49.682 --> 00:00:51.317
But, as always,
it wasn't enough for Trump

00:00:51.317 --> 00:00:52.885
to surround himself
with admirers.

00:00:52.885 --> 00:00:54.887
He also had to admire himself

00:00:54.887 --> 00:00:57.523
by talking about himself
in the third person.

00:00:57.523 --> 00:01:01.994
-We've produced everything
we said, and more, and more.

00:01:01.994 --> 00:01:03.763
[ Cheering and applause ]
Before it was talk, I said,

00:01:03.763 --> 00:01:05.164
"I'm gonna do this.

00:01:05.164 --> 00:01:07.133
We're gonna take care
of your trade."

00:01:07.133 --> 00:01:08.935
What we've done with China, now,

00:01:08.935 --> 00:01:11.171
on Wednesday, we sign --
That's tomorrow.

00:01:11.171 --> 00:01:14.940
[ Cheering and whistling ]
What we've done with the USMCA.

00:01:14.940 --> 00:01:18.277
What we've done with Japan:
$40 billion trade deal.

00:01:18.277 --> 00:01:20.680
[ Cheering and applause ]
And a lot of it has to do
with the farmers.

00:01:20.680 --> 00:01:22.715
[ Whistling ]
South Korea.

00:01:22.715 --> 00:01:24.616
Oh, you gotta love Trump.

00:01:24.616 --> 00:01:25.684
You gotta love Trump.

00:01:25.684 --> 00:01:26.786
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:26.786 --> 00:01:28.921
-No, we [chuckling] don't.

00:01:28.921 --> 00:01:30.556
[ Fresh laughter and applause ]
Trump is so

00:01:30.556 --> 00:01:32.892
detached from reality,
he's startin' to talk like

00:01:32.892 --> 00:01:35.495
a sitcom character
doin' his catchphrase.

00:01:35.495 --> 00:01:37.696
[as Trump]
Uh-oh. Looks like
the kitchen's on fire

00:01:37.696 --> 00:01:39.165
and the cops are here.

00:01:39.165 --> 00:01:40.799
Still,

00:01:40.799 --> 00:01:42.802
you gotta love Trump!

00:01:42.802 --> 00:01:46.439
[ Whimsical sting plays ]
[ Applause and cheering ]

00:01:54.380 --> 00:01:57.383
[ Laughter ]
By the way, sitcom Trump
is not a stretch.

00:01:57.383 --> 00:01:58.651
If you don't believe me,

00:01:58.651 --> 00:02:00.786
here's the president
of the United States

00:02:00.786 --> 00:02:02.955
goin' full "King of Queens"
and complaining,

00:02:02.955 --> 00:02:05.358
[laughing] once again,
about water pressure.

00:02:05.358 --> 00:02:07.493
-But sinks,

00:02:07.493 --> 00:02:11.297
[ Laughter ]
toilets, and showers.

00:02:11.297 --> 00:02:12.631
You don't get any water.

00:02:12.631 --> 00:02:15.502
-Are you...getting oxygen?

00:02:15.502 --> 00:02:17.036
[ Laughter and applause ]
To your brain?

00:02:17.036 --> 00:02:19.806
I don't wanna be critical,
but is it possible

00:02:19.806 --> 00:02:22.174
you're not paying
the White House water bill?

00:02:22.174 --> 00:02:23.809
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:23.809 --> 00:02:25.678
[as Trump]
"Final notice"?!

00:02:25.678 --> 00:02:27.680
[ Laughter ]

00:02:27.680 --> 00:02:30.984
And then, today Trump continued
his attempt to counterprogram

00:02:30.984 --> 00:02:32.385
House Speaker Nancy Pelosi's

00:02:32.385 --> 00:02:33.652
historic impeachment
announcement

00:02:33.652 --> 00:02:34.987
with his own announcement,

00:02:34.987 --> 00:02:37.924
on the first phase
of a trade deal with China.

00:02:37.924 --> 00:02:40.359
But it seemed like Trump never
got to the actual announcement

00:02:40.359 --> 00:02:42.628
because he spent
the entire press conference

00:02:42.628 --> 00:02:44.430
just callin' out the names

00:02:44.430 --> 00:02:46.131
of supporters
who were in the room.

00:02:46.131 --> 00:02:48.434
-Bob Lighthizer's really
an outstanding guy.

00:02:48.434 --> 00:02:49.935
Thank you very much, Steve.
Great job.

00:02:49.935 --> 00:02:51.637
Jared Kushner.
Where is Jared?

00:02:51.637 --> 00:02:53.606
And, Ivanka, nice to have
you here. Thank you, honey.

00:02:53.606 --> 00:02:54.774
Larry, you've been fantastic.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:54.774 --> 00:02:56.676
Peter Navarro.
Chris Liddell.

00:02:56.676 --> 00:02:58.377
Wilbur Ross.
Sonny Perdue.

00:02:58.377 --> 00:03:00.379
Elaine Chao.
The great Kevin McCarthy.

00:03:00.379 --> 00:03:02.214
[ Laughter ]
The great Lou Dobbs.
Henry Kissinger.

00:03:02.214 --> 00:03:03.649
A friend of mine,
Steve Schwarzman.

00:03:03.649 --> 00:03:04.750
Nelson Peltz is here.

00:03:04.750 --> 00:03:06.586
Hank Greenberg is here.
Hank.

00:03:06.586 --> 00:03:08.354
Steve Daines.
Joni Ernest.

00:03:08.354 --> 00:03:10.056
Deb Fischer.
Lindsey Graham.

00:03:10.056 --> 00:03:11.590
He's become a great
friend of mine.

00:03:11.590 --> 00:03:13.092
Chuck Grassley.
Jerry Moran.

00:03:13.092 --> 00:03:14.893
[ Applause ]
Rob Portman.
Pat Roberts.

00:03:14.893 --> 00:03:16.695
[ Laughter ]
Mike Rounds.
And Dan Sullivan.

00:03:16.695 --> 00:03:18.430
Vern Buchanan.
Mike Conaway.

00:03:18.430 --> 00:03:20.133
Kristi,
thank you for being here.

00:03:20.133 --> 00:03:21.367
I didn't know you were
gonna be here.

00:03:21.367 --> 00:03:22.734
[ Laughter ]
Mike Kelly
Drew Ferguson.

00:03:22.734 --> 00:03:24.336
Darin LaHood.
Michael McCaul.

00:03:24.336 --> 00:03:26.372
Patrick McHenry.
Devin Nunes.

00:03:26.372 --> 00:03:28.341
Adrian Smith.
David Abney.

00:03:28.341 --> 00:03:29.809
Darius Adamczyk.

00:03:29.809 --> 00:03:31.844
Ajay Banga, Mastercard.

00:03:31.844 --> 00:03:33.279
[ Laughter ]
Josh Bolten.

00:03:33.279 --> 00:03:35.013
-[as Trump]
Congratulations

00:03:35.013 --> 00:03:37.116
to the Class of 2020.

00:03:37.116 --> 00:03:41.653
[ Laughter and applause ]
Ohhhhh.

00:03:41.653 --> 00:03:44.223
Oh, the places you'll go.

00:03:44.223 --> 00:03:46.125
Jail.

00:03:46.125 --> 00:03:47.961
[ Laughter ]

00:03:47.961 --> 00:03:49.929
And then, in an even more
desperate attempt

00:03:49.929 --> 00:03:51.764
to counterprogram
the impeachment talk,

00:03:51.764 --> 00:03:54.367
Trump made a random
announcement, out of nowhere,

00:03:54.367 --> 00:03:56.569
about the 4th of July,
that had nothing to do

00:03:56.569 --> 00:03:59.305
with trade or China,
or, really, anything at all.

00:03:59.305 --> 00:04:02.074
-We're gonna do a big
fireworks display, right?

00:04:02.074 --> 00:04:03.576
Mount Rushmore.

00:04:03.576 --> 00:04:04.811
We're going over.

00:04:04.811 --> 00:04:06.846
I think I'm gonna try
to be there on July 4th.

00:04:06.846 --> 00:04:08.614
They haven't been there like
for 20 years.

00:04:08.614 --> 00:04:09.615
I said, "Why?"

00:04:09.615 --> 00:04:11.550
Environmental reasons.

00:04:11.550 --> 00:04:13.086
I said, "You mean,
can't have fireworks

00:04:13.086 --> 00:04:14.420
because of the environment?"

00:04:14.420 --> 00:04:16.755
Yeah, environmental reasons.

00:04:16.755 --> 00:04:18.624
I said, "What can burn?
It's stone, you know.

00:04:18.624 --> 00:04:19.625
[ Laughter ]
It's stone."

00:04:19.625 --> 00:04:20.693
-You idiot!

00:04:20.693 --> 00:04:22.562
It's in the Black Hills
of South Dakota!

00:04:22.562 --> 00:04:23.563
[ Laughter ]

00:04:23.563 --> 00:04:25.498
[laughing]
It's surrounded by trees.

00:04:25.498 --> 00:04:28.668
There's a forest like
right across the street.

00:04:28.668 --> 00:04:31.137
[ Laughter ]
'Cause he used to be
a New Yorker,

00:04:31.137 --> 00:04:33.072
Trump thinks everything is
in Times Square.

00:04:33.072 --> 00:04:34.239
[as Trump]
What can burn? It's stone.

00:04:34.239 --> 00:04:36.308
You just take the subway
up to Mount Rushmore

00:04:36.308 --> 00:04:37.710
[ Laughter ]
and then,

00:04:37.710 --> 00:04:40.112
when you're done, you go
next door to the M&amp;M store.

00:04:40.112 --> 00:04:42.214
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:04:42.214 --> 00:04:44.283
It's stone.
It's fine.

00:04:44.283 --> 00:04:46.219
But Trump's attempt to distract
from impeachment news

00:04:46.219 --> 00:04:48.387
did not work because,
as this was all happening,

00:04:48.387 --> 00:04:51.123
the House was also releasing
bombshell new documents

00:04:51.123 --> 00:04:53.459
involving Trump's lawyer
Rudy Giuliani

00:04:53.459 --> 00:04:55.728
and two of Rudy's
indicted associates,

00:04:55.728 --> 00:04:57.630
Lev Parnas and Igor Fruman.

00:04:57.630 --> 00:04:58.764
Remember these guys,

00:04:58.764 --> 00:05:01.300
the Mario and Luigi
of entry-level mobsters?

00:05:01.300 --> 00:05:03.836
[ Laughter and applause ]
They're the Soviet
Turner &amp; Hooch,

00:05:03.836 --> 00:05:05.471
except they're both Hooch.

00:05:05.471 --> 00:05:06.839
[ Laughter ]

00:05:06.839 --> 00:05:09.675
They look like off-brand
Russian Cabbage Patch Dolls.

00:05:09.675 --> 00:05:10.709
[Slavic accent]
What patch? Is just --

00:05:10.709 --> 00:05:12.377
[ Laughter ]
Is just cabbage doll.

00:05:12.377 --> 00:05:14.980
Now, let's remember
that it's well-established

00:05:14.980 --> 00:05:16.415
these guys were workin'
for Trump.

00:05:16.415 --> 00:05:19.151
There are multiple photos
of them with Trump and Rudy.

00:05:19.151 --> 00:05:22.020
They had at least ten separate
interactions with Trump.

00:05:22.020 --> 00:05:23.422
They told associates
they had been given

00:05:23.422 --> 00:05:24.957
a special assignment
by the president,

00:05:24.957 --> 00:05:26.826
like some sort
of James Bond mission,

00:05:26.826 --> 00:05:28.394
and one of Trump's
former lawyers --

00:05:28.394 --> 00:05:31.263
one of Trump's former lawyers --
even wrote a letter to Congress,

00:05:31.263 --> 00:05:34.533
stating that Parnas and Fruman
assisted Giuliani in connection

00:05:34.533 --> 00:05:36.535
with his representation
of President Trump.

00:05:36.535 --> 00:05:37.836
That's right, these guys!

00:05:37.836 --> 00:05:40.172
Who look like the guys
who spray your bowling shoes

00:05:40.172 --> 00:05:42.041
when you turn them in,
[ Laughter ]

00:05:42.041 --> 00:05:43.409
were supposedly
representing Trump.

00:05:43.409 --> 00:05:45.244
I guess it's all part
of Trump's strategy

00:05:45.244 --> 00:05:48.213
to surround himself with lawyers
who look guiltier than he does.

00:05:48.213 --> 00:05:51.317
If you saw all four of these
guys in a police lineup

00:05:51.317 --> 00:05:52.884
[ Laughter ]
and the cops asked you

00:05:52.884 --> 00:05:54.187
to point out the suspect,

00:05:54.187 --> 00:05:56.122
you'd need all four fingers.

00:05:56.122 --> 00:05:57.823
It was him.

00:05:57.823 --> 00:06:00.659
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:06:00.659 --> 00:06:03.396
So it's well-established these
guys worked directly for Trump

00:06:03.396 --> 00:06:04.830
in his scheme
to get Ukraine to interfere

00:06:04.830 --> 00:06:07.567
in the 2020 election
by digging up dirt on Joe Biden.

00:06:07.567 --> 00:06:08.934
In fact,
in one of those documents

00:06:08.934 --> 00:06:10.403
the House released last night,

00:06:10.403 --> 00:06:12.738
there was a letter,
written by Rudy,

00:06:12.738 --> 00:06:15.541
to the new Ukrainian president
in May of 2019,

00:06:15.541 --> 00:06:17.743
in which Rudy requested
a private meeting

00:06:17.743 --> 00:06:19.979
to discuss what we now know

00:06:19.979 --> 00:06:22.148
was their scheme to cheat
in the 2020 election.

00:06:22.148 --> 00:06:23.883
Rudy said explicitly,
in that letter,

00:06:23.883 --> 00:06:25.852
that he was working for Trump,

00:06:25.852 --> 00:06:27.453
while simultaneously
trying to claim

00:06:27.453 --> 00:06:30.423
he wasn't working
for the president

00:06:30.423 --> 00:06:32.491
and insisting that all
of this was very normal.

00:06:32.491 --> 00:06:33.992
Here's the first paragraph
of Rudy's letter.

00:06:33.992 --> 00:06:35.828
"Dear President-Elect Zelensky:

00:06:35.828 --> 00:06:38.597
I am private counsel
to President Donald J. Trump.

00:06:38.597 --> 00:06:39.698
Just to be precise,

00:06:39.698 --> 00:06:41.800
I represent him
as a private citizen,

00:06:41.800 --> 00:06:43.803
not as President
of the United States.

00:06:43.803 --> 00:06:45.838
This is quite common
under American law

00:06:45.838 --> 00:06:47.740
because the duties
and privileges of a President

00:06:47.740 --> 00:06:49.609
and a private citizen
are not the same.

00:06:49.609 --> 00:06:52.378
Separate representation
is usual process."

00:06:52.378 --> 00:06:54.113
Wow! When you have
to start your letter

00:06:54.113 --> 00:06:55.981
by explaining that what you're
doing is not suspicious,

00:06:55.981 --> 00:06:58.350
[ Laughter and applause ]
that is definitely suspicious.

00:06:58.350 --> 00:07:00.319
Like when you text a weed
dealer for the first time

00:07:00.319 --> 00:07:03.021
and say, "I am writing to obtain
marijuana for medical purposes,

00:07:03.021 --> 00:07:05.791
and not because my parents
are out of town."

00:07:05.791 --> 00:07:08.227
[ Laughter and applause ]
But, in many ways --

00:07:08.227 --> 00:07:10.763
[ Applause ]

00:07:10.763 --> 00:07:14.133
In many ways, that letter was
one of the least shocking things

00:07:14.133 --> 00:07:15.467
the House released last night.

00:07:15.467 --> 00:07:18.737
There were also additional
notes and text messages,

00:07:18.737 --> 00:07:21.506
related to the scheme to get
Ukrainian President Zelensky

00:07:21.506 --> 00:07:22.875
to investigate Joe Biden.

00:07:22.875 --> 00:07:25.877
For example, there are
handwritten notes, from Parnas,

00:07:25.877 --> 00:07:28.281
on stationery from the
Ritz-Carlton in Vienna,

00:07:28.281 --> 00:07:31.784
where Parnas literally says --
and these are completely real --

00:07:31.784 --> 00:07:34.620
"get Zalensky to announce
that the Biden case

00:07:34.620 --> 00:07:36.055
will Be Investigated

00:07:36.055 --> 00:07:38.357
and "do my 'magic'
and cut [a] deal."

00:07:38.357 --> 00:07:40.793
What magic was this
[laughing] guy gonna do?

00:07:40.793 --> 00:07:42.027
[ Laughter ]

00:07:42.027 --> 00:07:44.630
Other than make a meatball
sandwich disappear?

00:07:44.630 --> 00:07:46.832
[ Laughter and applause ]
[muffled] "Ta-da!"

00:07:46.832 --> 00:07:48.934
[ Laughter ]

00:07:48.934 --> 00:07:51.304
And then, there were
the text messages,

00:07:51.304 --> 00:07:54.106
which were ominous,
chilling, and bizarre.

00:07:54.106 --> 00:07:56.008
For example,
they also introduced

00:07:56.008 --> 00:07:58.410
a completely new character
into this whole saga:

00:07:58.410 --> 00:07:59.978
a Trump supporter
from Connecticut,

00:07:59.978 --> 00:08:02.414
named Robert Hyde,
who owns a landscaping business

00:08:02.414 --> 00:08:03.549
and ran for Congress.

00:08:03.549 --> 00:08:05.384
Hyde was apparently
working with Parnas

00:08:05.384 --> 00:08:06.918
on this whole scheme in Ukraine.

00:08:06.918 --> 00:08:08.754
And, yes, before you ask,

00:08:08.754 --> 00:08:11.823
there are multiple photos
of Hyde posing with Trump.

00:08:11.823 --> 00:08:13.859
How is it possible
that Trump has taken photos

00:08:13.859 --> 00:08:15.994
with every meathead goon
in the tri-state area?

00:08:15.994 --> 00:08:17.863
[ Laughter ]
Trump's like a mall Santa

00:08:17.863 --> 00:08:19.265
for wannabe goodfellas.

00:08:19.265 --> 00:08:21.167
[ Laughter and applause ]
These guys look like

00:08:21.167 --> 00:08:23.970
they're starring in a kid's show
called "Spongebob Squarehead."

00:08:23.970 --> 00:08:26.104
[ Laughter ]

00:08:26.104 --> 00:08:28.207
Parnas and Hyde, apparently,
had an ongoing exchange

00:08:28.207 --> 00:08:30.643
of text messages in which
they appeared to be stalking

00:08:30.643 --> 00:08:33.446
and spying on the former
U.S. ambassador to Ukraine,

00:08:33.446 --> 00:08:34.547
Marie Yovanovitch.

00:08:34.547 --> 00:08:36.215
You might remember
that Yovanovitch was

00:08:36.215 --> 00:08:37.783
a key impeachment witness,

00:08:37.783 --> 00:08:40.519
who was the target of smears
by Trump and his inner circle

00:08:40.519 --> 00:08:43.388
because she was a career
foreign service official

00:08:43.388 --> 00:08:46.191
who they saw as an obstacle
to their criminal scheme.

00:08:46.191 --> 00:08:48.861
In fact, at various points, she
was told Rudy, and his goons,

00:08:48.861 --> 00:08:51.597
had plans for her and that there
were concerns for her security.

00:08:51.597 --> 00:08:54.267
And, now, we have
these text messages,

00:08:54.267 --> 00:08:55.835
in which it appears
Hyde and Parnas

00:08:55.835 --> 00:08:58.070
were closely tracking
her movements

00:08:58.070 --> 00:09:00.473
and planning something
very ominous.

00:09:00.473 --> 00:09:02.708
-We are starting
to see the contents

00:09:02.708 --> 00:09:06.979
of the cellphone and files
of one Lev Parnas

00:09:06.979 --> 00:09:08.948
and it is giving us a window

00:09:08.948 --> 00:09:12.084
into a rather
astounding operation,

00:09:12.084 --> 00:09:15.922
supervised by Rudy Giuliani,
in the name of the president.

00:09:15.922 --> 00:09:17.223
[ Camera shutter clicking ]
-Text messages suggesting that

00:09:17.223 --> 00:09:19.392
former U.S. Ambassador
Marie Yovanovitch

00:09:19.392 --> 00:09:21.660
may have been
under physical surveillance.

00:09:21.660 --> 00:09:25.130
-Robert Hyde, a Trump supporter
and congressional candidate,

00:09:25.130 --> 00:09:28.767
claimed to have contact
with a "private security" team

00:09:28.767 --> 00:09:32.271
monitoring the ambassador's
moves and communications.

00:09:32.271 --> 00:09:33.972
-He's talking
about Marie Yovanovitch,

00:09:33.972 --> 00:09:35.007
the ambassador.

00:09:35.007 --> 00:09:37.276
He says,
"She's under heavy protection.

00:09:37.276 --> 00:09:39.078
She's talked to three people.

00:09:39.078 --> 00:09:40.179
Her phone is off.

00:09:40.179 --> 00:09:41.346
Her computer is off.

00:09:41.346 --> 00:09:43.549
They'll let me know
when she's on the move."

00:09:43.549 --> 00:09:46.418
Then, later that day,
"They're willing to help,

00:09:46.418 --> 00:09:48.987
if you/we would like a price."

00:09:48.987 --> 00:09:51.323
-Holy [bleep],
this idiot literally wrote

00:09:51.323 --> 00:09:54.126
in a text message that his guys
were willing to help

00:09:54.126 --> 00:09:55.494
"if you would like a price."

00:09:55.494 --> 00:09:59.231
These guys are a lot dumber
than the criminals on TV.

00:09:59.231 --> 00:10:01.166
[ Laughter ]
Those criminals are always
using burner phones

00:10:01.166 --> 00:10:03.168
and switching cars,
meeting in back alleys.

00:10:03.168 --> 00:10:05.371
In real life, these guys
were texting each other

00:10:05.371 --> 00:10:06.772
and puttin' up posters
on telephone poles,

00:10:06.772 --> 00:10:09.207
that said, "Looking
for thugs to do crimes.

00:10:09.207 --> 00:10:11.210
[ Laughter and applause ]
This is for Trump as citizen,

00:10:11.210 --> 00:10:12.244
not as president.

00:10:12.244 --> 00:10:14.412
He is my friend.
Here is a picture of us."

00:10:14.412 --> 00:10:16.649
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:10:16.649 --> 00:10:20.652
So, all, every bit,
of this damning new evidence

00:10:20.652 --> 00:10:22.788
is coming out as the Senate
prepares to hold

00:10:22.788 --> 00:10:25.423
only the third impeachment trial
of a president in history

00:10:25.423 --> 00:10:27.993
and, whatever happens,
that will be a historic stain

00:10:27.993 --> 00:10:30.629
on Trump's presidency that
will follow his name forever,

00:10:30.629 --> 00:10:33.198
which is a point
House Speaker Nancy Pelosi

00:10:33.198 --> 00:10:36.235
hit home multiple times
in her press conference today.

00:10:36.235 --> 00:10:38.104
[ Camera shutters
clicking continuously ]
-On December 18th,

00:10:38.104 --> 00:10:40.238
the House of Representatives

00:10:40.238 --> 00:10:43.409
impeached the president
of the United States,

00:10:43.409 --> 00:10:46.779
an impeachment
that will last forever.

00:10:46.779 --> 00:10:48.647
And, yes, it is a fact:

00:10:48.647 --> 00:10:51.617
When someone is impeached,
they are always impeached.

00:10:51.617 --> 00:10:53.418
It cannot be erased.

00:10:53.418 --> 00:10:55.354
-Oh, she definitely knew
Trump was watching.

00:10:55.354 --> 00:10:58.056
[ Laughter ]
She might as well have looked
directly into the camera

00:10:58.056 --> 00:11:00.158
and said, "Donald,
this will follow you.

00:11:00.158 --> 00:11:01.727
[echoing]<i> Forever.</i>

00:11:01.727 --> 00:11:03.395
[ Laughter ]
<i> Forever. Forever.</i>

00:11:03.395 --> 00:11:05.030
<i> Forever. Forever.</i>

00:11:05.030 --> 00:11:07.165
[ Applause ]
<i> Forever. Forever.</i>

00:11:07.165 --> 00:11:08.901
<i> Forever. Forever.</i>

00:11:08.901 --> 00:11:10.569
<i> Forever. Forever.</i>

00:11:10.569 --> 00:11:12.738
So the House voted today
to send the two articles

00:11:12.738 --> 00:11:14.740
that passed last year
to the Senate for a trial

00:11:14.740 --> 00:11:17.309
and Pelosi also appointed
impeachment managers,

00:11:17.309 --> 00:11:18.777
who are basically
just prosecutors,

00:11:18.777 --> 00:11:21.614
to make the case against Trump
during the trial.

00:11:21.614 --> 00:11:23.415
Pelosi said
she focused specifically

00:11:23.415 --> 00:11:26.651
on choosing experienced lawyers
when she made her selections.

00:11:26.651 --> 00:11:28.520
[ Camera shutters
clicking continuously ]
-Today I'm very proud

00:11:28.520 --> 00:11:31.290
to present the managers

00:11:31.290 --> 00:11:34.893
who will bring the case, which
we have great confidence in,

00:11:34.893 --> 00:11:38.731
in terms of impeaching
the president and his removal.

00:11:38.731 --> 00:11:41.533
Chair Adam Schiff of California,
lead manager.

00:11:41.533 --> 00:11:42.634
Chairman Jerry Nadler,

00:11:42.634 --> 00:11:45.170
chair of the
House Judiciary Committee.

00:11:45.170 --> 00:11:47.973
Chair Zoe Lofgren,
Chair Hakeem Jeffries,

00:11:47.973 --> 00:11:50.075
Congresswoman Val Demings,

00:11:50.075 --> 00:11:51.610
Congressman Jason Crow,

00:11:51.610 --> 00:11:53.512
Congresswoman Sylvia Garcia.

00:11:53.512 --> 00:11:56.682
The emphasis is on litigators.

00:11:56.682 --> 00:11:59.452
The emphasis is on comfort
level in the courtroom.

00:11:59.452 --> 00:12:01.219
-That's right:
Democrats are actually

00:12:01.219 --> 00:12:02.721
appointing
experienced litigators,

00:12:02.721 --> 00:12:04.623
whereas, Trump's team is just
a bunch of heavies

00:12:04.623 --> 00:12:06.692
he picked up off a street
corner in Bayonne.

00:12:06.692 --> 00:12:08.760
[ Laughter ]
You know, the guys Trump bought

00:12:08.760 --> 00:12:09.995
at Goons R Us.

00:12:09.995 --> 00:12:12.297
[ Laughter ]
They even all dress the same.

00:12:12.297 --> 00:12:13.298
I mean, look at this.

00:12:13.298 --> 00:12:14.699
These guys look like they shop

00:12:14.699 --> 00:12:17.268
at a store called Abercrombie
and Snitches Get Stitches.

00:12:17.268 --> 00:12:19.137
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:12:19.137 --> 00:12:20.539
So, Trump's
now preparing to face

00:12:20.539 --> 00:12:22.575
the third Senate
impeachment trial in history

00:12:22.575 --> 00:12:24.175
as more damning evidence emerges

00:12:24.175 --> 00:12:25.911
about the criminals
he surrounded himself with

00:12:25.911 --> 00:12:29.181
to carry out his illegal scheme
to cheat in the 2020 election.

00:12:29.181 --> 00:12:31.049
Trump will be on trial
for multiple crimes

00:12:31.049 --> 00:12:33.385
as his presidency goes
down multiple...

00:12:33.385 --> 00:12:34.753
-Toilets!

00:12:34.753 --> 00:12:36.988
[ Laughter and applause ]
